hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15996","Abu al-Jawwab narrated to us, Ammar ibn Ruzayq narrated to us, from Ata ibn al-Sa'ib, he said, a group of the people of Basra narrated to me, among them al-Hasan, from Ma'qil ibn Sinan al-Ashja'i: that he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) passed by me while I was being cupped on the eighteenth night past of the month of Ramadan, and said: The cupper and the one cupped have broken the fast."
